    "text": "The area of the triangle with vertices <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>)</mo></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>)</mo></math> is",
